---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Free Smart Talking Website Upgrade | Shelby Web Co"
  description="A fully custom-trained AI chatbot integration that can handle 24/7 customer support, sync with your calendar for automated bookings, and help your business stay responsive around the clock."
>
  <div class="w-full bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-darkest via-brand-darkest to-slate-900">
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="px-4 py-20 md:py-32 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center space-y-6">
        <div class="inline-block mb-4">
          <svg class="w-16 h-16 text-brand-cyan mx-auto" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0zm-9 5h.01M15.391 5.6l-.707.707M9.609 5.6L8.9 4.893m7.072 9.9h.01"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-white">
          <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-cyan to-brand-blue bg-clip-text text-transparent">Always Available.</span><br />
          <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-blue to-brand-cyan bg-clip-text text-transparent">Always Closing.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-slate-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          A fully custom-trained AI chatbot integration that can handle 24/7 customer support, sync with your calendar for automated bookings, and keep your business responsive around the clock.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto italic">
          Website would be free of charge; the only entailment is the $297/mo. AI chatbot setup, training, and maintenance fee.
        </p>
        <div class="pt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
          <a
            href="/contact?service=ai-chatbot"
            class="cta-glow-shine inline-block bg-brand-accent text-brand-darkest px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-bold text-lg hover:bg-brand-accent-light transition-all duration-300 transform hover:scale-105"
          >
            Activate Your AI Agent
          </a>
          <a
            href="#how-it-works"
            class="inline-block bg-slate-700 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-bold text-lg hover:bg-slate-600 transition-all duration-300"
          >
            Learn How It Works
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- What It Really Does Section -->
    <section class="px-4 py-16 md:py-24 max-w-6xl mx-auto border-t border-slate-700">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-16 text-white">
        What It <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-cyan to-brand-blue bg-clip-text text-transparent">Really</span> Does
      </h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-8">
        <div class="bg-slate-800/50 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg p-8 hover:border-brand-cyan transition-colors">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-cyan mb-4">24/7 Lead Qualification</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300">
            Your AI agent engages every visitor instantly. It asks the right questions, understands their needs, and qualifies them before they ever talk to a human. No leads slip through cracks at night or on weekends.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-800/50 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg p-8 hover:border-brand-cyan transition-colors">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-cyan mb-4">Objection Handling</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300">
            "How much does it cost? How long does it take?" Your AI doesn't dodge tough questions—it answers them, explains value, and keeps the conversation moving toward a sale. It's trained on your exact services and pricing.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-800/50 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg p-8 hover:border-brand-cyan transition-colors">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-cyan mb-4">Intelligent Routing</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300">
            The AI doesn't just collect info—it directs prospects to your highest-value services. Someone asking about SEO gets shown your SEO case studies. A referral partner gets shown your referral program. Perfect guidance at the right moment.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-800/50 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg p-8 hover:border-brand-cyan transition-colors">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-cyan mb-4">Deal Closing Power</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300">
            It doesn't just collect leads—it actually closes deals. By the time a prospect reaches your inbox, they're already convinced. The AI has addressed concerns, explained benefits, and built confidence in your solution.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Business Benefits Section -->
    <section class="px-4 py-16 md:py-24 max-w-6xl mx-auto border-t border-slate-700">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-16 text-white">
        Real Business <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-cyan to-brand-blue bg-clip-text text-transparent">Impact</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-cyan/20 to-brand-blue/20 border border-brand-cyan/30 rounded-lg p-8">
          <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-brand-cyan mb-3">+40%</div>
          <p class="text-white font-semibold mb-2">More Qualified Leads</p>
          <p class="text-slate-300">Better questions = better prospects. Your AI filters out tire-kickers and focuses on real buyers.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-cyan/20 to-brand-blue/20 border border-brand-cyan/30 rounded-lg p-8">
          <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-brand-cyan mb-3">50+ hrs/mo</div>
          <p class="text-white font-semibold mb-2">Time Saved</p>
          <p class="text-slate-300">Stop answering the same questions. Your AI handles initial conversations while you focus on closing.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-cyan/20 to-brand-blue/20 border border-brand-cyan/30 rounded-lg p-8">
          <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-brand-cyan mb-3">24/7</div>
          <p class="text-white font-semibold mb-2">Always Working</p>
          <p class="text-slate-300">Revenue generation doesn't stop when you sleep. Your AI is always engaging, always qualifying, always closing.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- How Implementation Works Section -->
    <section id="how-it-works" class="px-4 py-16 md:py-24 max-w-6xl mx-auto border-t border-slate-700">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-16 text-white">
        How <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-cyan to-brand-blue bg-clip-text text-transparent">Implementation</span> Works
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <div class="flex gap-6">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-center h-12 w-12 rounded-lg bg-brand-accent text-brand-darkest font-bold text-lg">
              1
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Discovery Call</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-300">We learn your services, your ideal clients, your common objections, and your unique value proposition. This ensures your AI represents you perfectly.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-6">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-center h-12 w-12 rounded-lg bg-brand-accent text-brand-darkest font-bold text-lg">
              2
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">AI Training</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-300">We build your custom AI knowledge base—everything from your service details to your pricing to your sales strategy. It's trained specifically for your business.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-6">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-center h-12 w-12 rounded-lg bg-brand-accent text-brand-darkest font-bold text-lg">
              3
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Integration</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-300">The AI widget goes live on your site in one strategic location. It greets visitors, engages in natural conversation, and captures every lead automatically.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-6">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-center h-12 w-12 rounded-lg bg-brand-accent text-brand-darkest font-bold text-lg">
              4
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Optimization</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-300">We monitor conversations, refine responses, and continuously improve performance. Your AI gets smarter as it learns what works best for your business.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Use Cases Section -->
    <section class="px-4 py-16 md:py-24 max-w-6xl mx-auto border-t border-slate-700">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-16 text-white">
        Real-World <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-cyan to-brand-blue bg-clip-text text-transparent">Deal Closing</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-slate-800/50 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg p-8">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-cyan mb-3">Prospect: "Is web design really worth it?"</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 mb-4">
            Your AI explains ROI, shares relevant case studies, walks them through the process timeline, and answers budget questions. By the time they request a consultation, they're already sold on the concept.
          </p>
          <p class="text-brand-cyan font-semibold">Result: Pre-qualified lead ready to close.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-800/50 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg p-8">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-cyan mb-3">After-Hours Inquiry: "Tell me about your SEO services"</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 mb-4">
            2 AM. Your AI responds with detailed info, answers about competitive advantage, explains pricing tiers, and asks qualifying questions. The prospect is impressed by the instant response and joins your email nurture list.
          </p>
          <p class="text-brand-cyan font-semibold">Result: Lead captured when competitors sleep.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-800/50 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg p-8">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-cyan mb-3">Referral Partner: "How does the program work?"</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 mb-4">
            Your AI instantly shows the referral bonus structure, earnings scenarios, and how to get their custom tracking link. They're ready to promote you before talking to anyone. No bottleneck. No delay.
          </p>
          <p class="text-brand-cyan font-semibold">Result: Partner activated immediately.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-800/50 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg p-8">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-cyan mb-3">Existing Customer: "Do you offer maintenance plans?"</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 mb-4">
            Your AI understands they're a customer and routes them to your maintenance/support solutions. It explains the upsell value and collects their interest. Your next revenue opportunity is captured automatically.
          </p>
          <p class="text-brand-cyan font-semibold">Result: Revenue expansion opportunity.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FAQ Section -->
    <section class="px-4 py-16 md:py-24 max-w-3xl mx-auto border-t border-slate-700">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-16 text-white">
        Frequently Asked <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-cyan to-brand-blue bg-clip-text text-transparent">Questions</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <details class="group bg-slate-800/50 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg p-6 cursor-pointer hover:border-brand-cyan transition-colors">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-white">
            Won't my customers feel like they're talking to a bot?
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3"></path>
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <p class="text-slate-300 mt-4">
            Not at all. Our AI is trained to sound natural and conversational. It's more like talking to a knowledgeable team member than a robot. Customers often don't even know they're talking to AI—they just know they got helpful answers immediately.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="group bg-slate-800/50 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg p-6 cursor-pointer hover:border-brand-cyan transition-colors">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-white">
            What if a customer asks something my AI doesn't know?
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3"></path>
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <p class="text-slate-300 mt-4">
            The AI gracefully handles edge cases and offers to connect them with someone who can help. It collects their contact info in the process. Nothing is lost—you just get a more qualified lead with context about what they were asking.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="group bg-slate-800/50 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg p-6 cursor-pointer hover:border-brand-cyan transition-colors">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-white">
            Can I update what the AI knows about my business?
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3"></path>
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <p class="text-slate-300 mt-4">
            Absolutely. If you launch a new service, change your pricing, or update your process, just let us know. We keep your AI's knowledge base current so it always represents your latest offerings accurately.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="group bg-slate-800/50 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg p-6 cursor-pointer hover:border-brand-cyan transition-colors">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-white">
            How do I get the conversations and leads captured by the AI?
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3"></path>
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <p class="text-slate-300 mt-4">
            Every conversation and lead is logged in your dashboard and also sent directly to your email and CRM. You see exactly what the prospect asked, what the AI recommended, and their contact information. Zero leads are lost.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="group bg-slate-800/50 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg p-6 cursor-pointer hover:border-brand-cyan transition-colors">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-white">
            What happens if I get a surge in conversations at once?
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3"></path>
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <p class="text-slate-300 mt-4">
            Your AI handles it instantly. Whether 10 people or 1,000 people are asking questions at the same time, every single one gets immediate attention. This is the advantage of AI—it scales without bottlenecks.
          </p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Final CTA Section -->
    <section class="px-4 py-16 md:py-24 max-w-4xl mx-auto border-t border-slate-700 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">
        Ready to Turn Visitors Into <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-cyan to-brand-blue bg-clip-text text-transparent">Qualified Leads?</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-slate-300 mb-10">
        Your AI agent is ready to work 24/7. Let's talk about how to make it yours.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/contact?service=ai-chatbot"
        class="cta-glow-shine inline-block bg-brand-accent text-brand-darkest px-10 py-5 rounded-lg font-bold text-xl hover:bg-brand-accent-light transition-all duration-300 transform hover:scale-105"
      >
        Start Your AI Agent Today
      </a>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-6">
        Free consultation. No commitment. Just results.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
